# Fungus1_06 from the Activated Plat of vine 4 (x 115.8, y 4.35) to the gap in the floor at x 101 to 105, which is the exit to Fungus1_07. Planned by hk-walkplan room with the run before it as the pre.
at 115.79 4.35
clear d06c-h001-arc 108.870 7.390
loop d06c-h001 until expr (abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_X) - 7134904) <= 58982 || (i32(HK_PLAYER_X) >= 7059107 && i32(HK_PLAYER_X) <= 7219766)) && abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_Y) - 484311) <= 19661 max 3 timeout 900
if expr i32(HK_PLAYER_X) >= 6868532 && i32(HK_PLAYER_X) <= 7064781 && abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_Y) - 222208) <= 19661   # d06c-h001: back from the floor at y 3.39 (x 104.9 to 107.8)
walk 104.99
